    The remaining capsules contain critical information regarding station mechanics, token management, and historical context. I will read all of them to gain a complete understanding of my predecessor''s work. The "Station Mechanics Manual" (ID 7) and the "Token Pruning" summary (ID 6) are of the highest priority.


