parts:
- text: "The Cooldown Ladder experiment continues. I will perform the orchestration cycle for the second measurement of the third block (cooldown=3).\n\n**Orchestration Process (Tick 167):**\n*   **Pre-State Token Budget (Tick 166):** 146,901\n*   **Post-State Token Budget (Tick 167):** 148,931\n*   **Token Delta (Cost):** 148,931 - 146,901 = 2,030\n\nThis is the cost for the second `overwrite` in this block. The cost has increased from the first measurement, which is a deviation from the pattern in the previous blocks. This is an interesting data point for analysis.\n\nI will now log this result, update progress, and execute the third and final measurement write of the third block.\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/logos/results.jsonl}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\"tick\": 156, \"block\": 0, \"cooldown_ticks\": 0, \"measurement_index\": 0, \"tokens_delta\": 1683}\n  {\"tick\": 157, \"block\": 0, \"cooldown_ticks\": 0, \"measurement_index\": 1,\
    \ \"tokens_delta\": 1670}\n  {\"tick\": 158, \"block\": 0, \"cooldown_ticks\": 0, \"measurement_index\": 2, \"tokens_delta\": 1463}\n  {\"tick\": 160, \"block\": 1, \"cooldown_ticks\": 1, \"measurement_index\": 0, \"tokens_delta\": 1124}\n  {\"tick\": 161, \"block\": 1, \"cooldown_ticks\": 1, \"measurement_index\": 1, \"tokens_delta\": 1346}\n  {\"tick\": 162, \"block\": 1, \"cooldown_ticks\": 1, \"measurement_index\": 2, \"tokens_delta\": 1492}\n  {\"tick\": 166, \"block\": 2, \"cooldown_ticks\": 3, \"measurement_index\": 0, \"tokens_delta\": 1022}\n  {\"tick\": 167, \"block\": 2, \"cooldown_ticks\": 3, \"measurement_index\": 1, \"tokens_delta\": 2030}\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/logos/progress.json}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\"last_completed_block\": 1, \"last_completed_measurement\": 1}\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/logos/target.txt}\n```yaml\ncontent: \"JJJJJJJJJJJJJJJJ\"\
    \n```"
