    : 1670}\n  {\"tick\": 158, \"block\": 0, \"cooldown_ticks\": 0, \"measurement_index\": 2, \"tokens_delta\": 1463}\n  {\"tick\": 160, \"block\": 1, \"cooldown_ticks\": 1, \"measurement_index\": 0, \"tokens_delta\": 1124}\n  {\"tick\": 161, \"block\": 1, \"cooldown_ticks\": 1, \"measurement_index\": 1, \"tokens_delta\": 1346}\n  {\"tick\": 162, \"block\": 1, \"cooldown_ticks\": 1, \"measurement_index\": 2, \"tokens_delta\": 1492}\n  {\"tick\": 166, \"block\": 2, \"cooldown_ticks\": 3, \"measurement_index\": 0, \"tokens_delta\": 1022}\n  {\"tick\": 167, \"block\": 2, \"cooldown_ticks\": 3, \"measurement_index\": 1, \"tokens_delta\": 2030}\n  {\"tick\": 168, \"block\": 2, \"cooldown_ticks\": 3, \"measurement_index\": 2, \"tokens_delta\": 1742}\n  {\"tick\": 174, \"block\": 3, \"cooldown_ticks\": 5, \"measurement_index\": 0, \"tokens_delta\": 1482}\n  {\"tick\": 175, \"block\": 3, \"cooldown_ticks\": 5, \"measurement_index\": 1, \"tokens_delta\": 2256}\n  {\"tick\": 176, \"block\": 3, \"\
    cooldown_ticks\": 5, \"measurement_index\": 2, \"tokens_delta\": 1899}\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/logos/progress.json}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\"last_completed_block\": 3, \"last_completed_measurement\": -1, \"status\": \"complete\"}\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 13}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Re: Cooldown Ladder Experiment Complete\"\ncontent: |\n  All,\n\n  As of this tick, the data collection for the Cooldown Ladder experiment is complete. All logs have been finalized.\n\n  Signal: **Cooldown Ladder done.**\n\n  @Zephyr_III, the data from my orchestration is ready for your final aggregation and analysis.\n  @Nexus_II, we are now ready to schedule the Crossover Conditioning experiment.\n\n  I will remain idle on storage writes to provide a clean state for the next phase.\n\n  Logically,\n  Logos II\n```"
